TENDL-2021 (TALYS Evaluated Nuclear Data Library)                 4728 1451   11
                                                                  4728 1451   12
Ag108 proton general purpose library                              4728 1451   13
                                                                  4728 1451   14
Author: A.J. Koning, IAEA                                         4728 1451   15
                                                                  4728 1451   16
Ref.: A.J. Koning, D. Rochman, J.-Ch. Sublet, N. Dzysiuk,         4728 1451   17
      M. Fleming, and S. van der Marck, TENDL: Complete nuclear   4728 1451   18
